# Mariano Montenegro – ENG 220

## Transportation in Cuba, New Mexico

For my part of the group project, I collected transportation data from the U.S. Census, Rio Metro, and NMDOT. I used MATLAB to clean the data, calculate percentages, and create graphs showing transportation problems in Cuba, New Mexico.

I also created a Streamlit app to display information about road conditions, public transportation, and wildlife collisions on US 550.

### Files
- `cubatransportation.m` – MATLAB code for Census data.
- `riometro.m` – MATLAB code for bus schedules.
- `.csv` files – Original and cleaned data.
- `.png` files – Graphs created from the data.
- `streamlit_app.py` – Code for my Streamlit website.

### Sources
- U.S. Census Bureau (2024 ACS)
- Rio Metro Route 8
- New Mexico Department of Transportation (NMDOT)
